# S13 Red Alert SCG01EA: a building changes owner on screen. The Soviet barracks is
# brought below a quarter of its strength, an Allied engineer is put down beside it and
# sent in, and the barracks is captured (its colour changes to the Allies'). The fog and
# invulnerability cheats let the engine see the barracks and keep the engineer alive
# past the Tesla coil beside it. Framed before, while the engineer walks in, and after.
game: ra
scen: SCG01EA
modes: enh,cls,n64
---
gfxload {CFG}
gfx show_stats 0
reveal 1
tick 1
frames 2
cam 62.5 65.5
frames 2
shot {OUT}/t0001_barracks.png
hurtobj BARR 0
hurtobj BARR 0
hurtobj BARR 0
hurtobj BARR 0
hurtobj BARR 0
hurtobj BARR 0
hurtobj BARR 0
cheatset fog 1
cheatset invuln 1
tick 5
spawnobj E6 59 67
tick 2
frames 2
obj BARR 0
obj E6 0
lclickobj E6 0
tick 1
orderobj BARR 0
tick 2
frames 2
shot {OUT}/t0008_order.png
tick 40
frames 2
obj BARR 0
memledger t48
shot {OUT}/t0048_after.png
tick 60
frames 2
obj BARR 0
shot {OUT}/t0108_after.png
quit
